Mixed and derived material requiring review
------------------------------------------
The SINES constant in src/sines.rs is copied from the original game's
dat/sines.dat. The project's license grant for surrounding Rust code does
not grant rights in that imported table.

assets/steam/gameplay.png is a screenshot of this game's rendering, and
assets/steam/hero.png is derived from that screenshot. Their content
includes geometry based on original game definitions. They require review
and are not represented as wholly project-authored GPLv3 artwork.

Other source-derived geometry, lettering, and level data also require a
provenance and rights review. The file list above identifies known imports;
it is not an exhaustive determination of the rights in all derived material.

